{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0440_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0440_story_06_title", "source_sha256": "0680acbdce85730b42a14a74b000c199dc1a0fb4295b20bd40e3afeaddb94214", "ja": "コ・モデルな二人", "zh": "小小模特儿二人组", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0440_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0440_story_06_synopsis", "source_sha256": "3340d52786b93edb45b66fe6c6ccdc85bacfbe0cd169ffcaa9bbcbbf4d9e779e", "ja": "両社合同の撮影日。朋花と可憐の録り直しも\nバッチリ成功。その仕上がりの良さに、それ\nぞれの社員もヒートアップ。朋花と可憐も、\n競い合いつつお互いを認め合い、一同は勝負\nの結果を待つのだった。", "zh": "两家公司联合拍摄的日子。朋花和可怜的重拍也\n顺利完成。看到成片效果如此出色，双方的员工\n也都热情高涨。朋花和可怜一边互相竞争，一边\n认可彼此，众人就这样等待着胜负\n的结果。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0440_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0440_story_06_1000_p", "source_sha256": "0c24d712da4cb06bc1ab94186e8b3599d34b0fc32a91c0436842d4938d922108", "ja": "（今日は、両陣営合同の撮影日。幾つかの細かい\nスチルに加えて、朋花と可憐の再撮がある……）", "zh": "（今天是双方阵营联合拍摄的日子。除了几张细节方面的静态照片外，还要重拍朋花和可怜的镜头……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0440_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0440_story_06_1001_031tom", "source_sha256": "0d66ab087930c89dd5f317de27ca1a3e3db5019957e5c2ebb85861a5ec42a4d5", "ja": "{$P$}さん、よろしいですか～？\n私が持つアイテムが決まりましたよ～。", "zh": "{$P$}先生，可以打扰一下吗～？\n我已经选好要拿的道具了哦～。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0440_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0440_story_06_1002_031tom", "source_sha256": "eb25009055a2d204fce7ede252b3fe35c9107e20a8087e913315a43ecf71ea23", "ja": "こちらの、扇子にしようと思います～。\n扇子入れとセットになっていて、可愛いんですよ～。", "zh": "我想选这把扇子～  \n它和扇子套是成套的，很可爱哦～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0440_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0440_story_06_1003_p", "source_sha256": "8debe5c74405a39a8677f85af9394de6695fb17281f5f52579fe44c504eb4402", "ja": "スカジの扇子？　そんなものがあったのか……！\nまあハイブランドって、たまに独特な商品あるよな。", "zh": "斯卡吉的扇子？居然还有这种东西……！\n不过高端品牌偶尔确实会有些独特的商品。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0440_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0440_story_06_1004_031tom", "source_sha256": "9d459022aa98157b21c7888b304da199dba32ca7fb6c8d2dfc0ca4138fb5b857", "ja": "扇子にしては、なかなかのお値段ですが……\n私が使って、その価値をさらに高めてあげましょう～。", "zh": "作为扇子来说，价格还真是不菲呢……\n就让我来使用它，让它的价值更上一层楼吧～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0440_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0440_story_06_1005_045kar", "source_sha256": "058121f24fbc9ed4f9e9d01cc0b299aa8abe172e87e2e4614cf8551daf35391d", "ja": "朋花ちゃん、そろそろ私たちの撮影だって……\nが、頑張ろうね……！", "zh": "朋花，差不多该轮到我们拍摄了……\n加、加油吧……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0440_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0440_story_06_1006_031tom", "source_sha256": "e089d6b71ed0fde2def0ee03a1df7932d583cff7d82093ab37ca9d6711696798", "ja": "可憐さん、ありがとうございます～。\nでは、行きましょうか～。", "zh": "可怜，谢谢你～。\n那么，我们走吧～。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0440_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0440_story_06_1007_045kar", "source_sha256": "c4833fc94727ba2045371e17001e2f87f44ff8b49634773420db349f87e58f0d", "ja": "{$P$}さん……\nい、行ってきますね。あの……", "zh": "{$P$}先生……\n我、我先走了哦。那个……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0440_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0440_story_06_1008_045kar", "source_sha256": "518ecf0455b9deedd1a8c45a6a7a7fa15ff99538c55ebdb7a7fe12f6f0a48153", "ja": "私たちから、目を逸らさないでくださいね……\n後悔、しちゃいますよ……なんて。てへへ。", "zh": "请不要把目光从我们身上移开哦……\n会后悔的哦……说笑啦。嘿嘿。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0440_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0440_story_06_1009_null", "source_sha256": "efc1d82f27c00c2cd66242ba3968b75b5084f0ad635f478df59f2ea4ca40369e", "ja": "そして……", "zh": "然后……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0440_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0440_story_06_1010_camman", "source_sha256": "221e73bb2183a66a97d3fda557132d60820eca8c3331f71dd06d4c9977cf8fa8", "ja": "……はーい、オッケーです！", "zh": "……好——的，没问题了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0440_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0440_story_06_1011_021mat", "source_sha256": "135d35a0635c2b2304c0b7028b002393ee004087f6bbbb0c39887368a32c1935", "ja": "二人とも、お疲れ様なのです！\nとびきり・びゅーりほー！だったのですよ！", "zh": "你们两个都辛苦了！\n真是特别特别漂亮的表演呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0440_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0440_story_06_1012_034ayu", "source_sha256": "a431aa06b79c1aed27bf113cf5142aa6dc599e856cb86971ea91b3c96b26110a", "ja": "めちゃくちゃクールだったよ！\nこないだと何かが違って……オーラ？　プレッシャー？", "zh": "太帅气了！\n跟之前感觉有些不一样……是气场？还是压迫感？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0440_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0440_story_06_1013_sukajikouhou", "source_sha256": "3166409bc594c3ed916b79e0e2950dd647f47f9335c7000a7eeee2b50a31ab8f", "ja": "天空橋様！　その立ち姿、醸し出す気配……\nスカジの顔として、完ぺきでした。感謝いたします。", "zh": "天空桥大人！那站姿，散发出的气质……\n作为斯卡蒂的代言人，真是无可挑剔。非常感谢您。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0440_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0440_story_06_1014_052kao", "source_sha256": "950aee3626a64343d853d25f8fe6647cb9306b1b838f2944c5534576c9badc3a", "ja": "どっちも素敵すぎて、甲乙つけがたいわね……\n二人が選ばれた理由が、改めて理解できたわ。", "zh": "两位都太出色了，实在难分高下呢……\n我再次明白了你们两位被选中的理由。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0440_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0440_story_06_1015_006mak", "source_sha256": "e040f72cd1e9bf1a8cde7d28df98bb5502858bdba2415b60c00f70df811f50e9", "ja": "堂々としていながら、可愛さもあって……\nくぅ～っ、しびれるなぁ！", "zh": "既堂堂正正，又透着可爱……\n呜～，太带感了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0440_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0440_story_06_1016_mirasumirankouhou", "source_sha256": "1be7d35563424c9338dd299e64704f9dba560c3eafd8dee0d1b1618808b60dde", "ja": "篠宮様、最高でした～！　わたくしのイメージ以上で\n……これなら、スカジさんにも勝てそうです～！", "zh": "篠宫大人，实在是太棒了～！完全超出了我的想象……这样一来，说不定连斯卡蒂小姐都能赢了～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0440_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0440_story_06_1017_sukajikouhou", "source_sha256": "8d79473385c3926f41d6b73e9a81a426d2e75c00e042ef6b84d5b6fc6b55e83f", "ja": "おや……ミラスさん？\n勝利宣言には、まだ早いと思いますが。", "zh": "哎呀……米拉斯先生？  \n不过，我觉得现在还没到宣布胜利的时候。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0440_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0440_story_06_1018_mirasumirankouhou", "source_sha256": "2e288e56d3f791e5b6a586c0f0582795438a1d656fb9987039aa454525b0d737", "ja": "おっと、失礼いたしました～、ふふふ♪", "zh": "哎呀，失礼了～，呵呵呵♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0440_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0440_story_06_1019_p", "source_sha256": "a8068a292f2366e6e817ce144dfc4283245cfeada1e2d44c3898440457cb7257", "ja": "（おお……今度は、こっち側がひりついてきた。\nそれだけ、朋花と可憐の仕事がよかったんだろうな！）", "zh": "（哦……这边也开始紧张起来了。\n看来这都是朋花和可怜出色工作的成果啊！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0440_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0440_story_06_1020_045kar", "source_sha256": "75c86d587f0d7bd677c9530111bbfafbdf815b8a899b580aff1d345511324363", "ja": "わ、私は、朋花ちゃんの背中を追っていただけだから\n……すごいのは、朋花ちゃんだよ……。", "zh": "我、我只是在追赶朋花的身影而已\n……厉害的是朋花才对……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0440_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0440_story_06_1021_031tom", "source_sha256": "d90909f9facc0eb36c01afae8851817cc0f1cda1ad474172183a68f521b6dc24", "ja": "おや～？　おかしな謙遜をしますね～。", "zh": "哎呀～？您这谦虚得可真奇怪呢～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0440_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0440_story_06_1022_031tom", "source_sha256": "1f87cb8767473b62ea6f95bf770578299c2fe780c59fe31378276146b105cd19", "ja": "私をここまでたどり着かせてくれたのは、\n他ならぬ、可憐さんなんですが～？", "zh": "能让我走到这里的，正是可怜小姐呀～？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0440_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0440_story_06_1023_045kar", "source_sha256": "5d0142728a0b2b320fa0a63d9c27b48e562a9ff685098605449d2bab00c257ff", "ja": "ええっ、そ、そんな……！", "zh": "诶诶，这、这怎么会……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0440_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0440_story_06_1024_p", "source_sha256": "11ca0a27966dc7aa2fcd6105c1b261f4bfb03a7dc53c5a071ccb82aff173dca9", "ja": "（駅の広告ジャックも、じきに始まる……\nファンのみんなの反応が楽しみだ！）", "zh": "（车站广告包场也马上就要开始了……\n真期待粉丝们的反应啊！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
